{"id":"5c7f032a842f6b9a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible.md","title":"Join Irreducibility of the Complete Solovay Degree","display":"thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible — Join Irreducibility of the Complete Solovay Degree","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible","aliases":["43-thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible"],"display":"thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible — Join Irreducibility of the Complete Solovay Degree","depends_on":["[[43-df-solovay-complete]]","[[43-thm-solovay-addition-join]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 13.4.2; Corollary 13.4.10","source_printed_pages":"346; 351","source_pdf_pages":"366; 371","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible — Join Irreducibility of the Complete Solovay Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6dd9273bb929547\" href=\"?note=a6dd9273bb929547\" title=\"43-df-solovay-complete\">43-df-solovay-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"88898ebf913a1fd0\" href=\"?note=88898ebf913a1fd0\" title=\"43-thm-solovay-addition-join\">43-thm-solovay-addition-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 13.4.2; Corollary 13.4.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"346; 351"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"366; 371"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6dd9273bb929547\" href=\"?note=a6dd9273bb929547\" title=\"43-df-solovay-complete\">43-df-solovay-complete</a>，加法上确界采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"88898ebf913a1fd0\" href=\"?note=88898ebf913a1fd0\" title=\"43-thm-solovay-addition-join\">43-thm-solovay-addition-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha+\\beta)\\iff\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha)\\lor\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha+\\beta)\\iff\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha)\\lor\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右向左由加法上确界和完全性定义给出；左向右是 Theorem 13.4.2 的最高度不可由两个真下方度生成的陈述。Corollary 13.4.10 给出等价的随机左 c.e. 实数版本。没有照抄紧接着的草稿 Theorem 13.4.11 中“不能写成两个左 c.e. 数之和”的字面句子，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma=0+\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma=0+\\gamma\\)</span> 立即反驳它；若讨论随机性分解，必须限制两个加数均非随机。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 13.4.2; Corollary 13.4.10；印刷页 346; 351，PDF 页 366; 371。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-complete","status":"resolved","id":"a6dd9273bb929547","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-solovay-addition-join","status":"resolved","id":"88898ebf913a1fd0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-addition-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-complete","status":"resolved","id":"a6dd9273bb929547","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-complete]]，加法上确界采用 [[43-thm-solovay-addition-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-solovay-addition-join","status":"resolved","id":"88898ebf913a1fd0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-complete]]，加法上确界采用 [[43-thm-solovay-addition-join]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha+\\beta)\\iff\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha)\\lor\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\beta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma=0+\\gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1788,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-321","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-complete-join-irreducible]] — Join Irreducibility of the Complete Solovay Degree"}],"out